msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore modelcontextprotocol  */}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP Server {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers is a collection of [Model Context Protocol (MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) servers that integrate quantum computing capabilities into AI systems. These servers enable AI assistants, large language models (LLMs), and agents to access IBM Quantum&reg; services and Qiskit libraries.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP Server ist eine Sammlung von [Model Context Protocol (MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/)-Servern, die Quantencomputing-Funktionen in KI-Systeme integrieren. Diese Server ermöglichen KI-Assistenten, Large Language Models (LLMs) und Agenten den Zugriff auf IBM Quantum&reg;-Dienste und Qiskit-Bibliotheken.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an open-source project. For the most up-to-date information, detailed API coverage, and advanced configurations, refer to the [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Dies ist ein Open-Source-Projekt. Die aktuellsten Informationen, eine detaillierte API-Abdeckung und erweiterte Konfigurationen findest du im [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub-Repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When should I use Qiskit MCP Servers? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Wann sollte ich Qiskit MCP Server verwenden? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-mcp-servers}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers allow AI assistants to help you with quantum computing tasks, such as the following:\n"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP Server ermöglichen KI-Assistenten, dir bei Quantencomputing-Aufgaben zu helfen, zum Beispiel:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating, manipulating, and transpiling quantum circuits\n"
msgstr "Erstellen, Bearbeiten und Transpilieren von Quantum Circuits\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieving and searching Qiskit documentation, guides, and API references\n"
msgstr "Abrufen und Durchsuchen der Qiskit-Dokumentation, Anleitungen und API-Referenzen\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Answering quantum computing questions directly from reliable sources\n"
msgstr "Beantworten von Quantencomputing-Fragen direkt aus zuverlässigen Quellen\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating quantum code with contextual awareness\n"
msgstr "Generieren von Quantencode mit kontextuellem Verständnis\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimizing circuits using AI-powered transpilation\n"
msgstr "Optimieren von Circuits mithilfe KI-gestützter Transpilation\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting to real quantum hardware automatically\n"
msgstr "Automatisches Verbinden mit echter Quantenhardware\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Analyzing and selecting optimal quantum backends\n"
msgstr "Analysieren und Auswählen optimaler Quantum Backends\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Executing quantum circuits and tracking job status\n"
msgstr "Ausführen von Quantum Circuits und Verfolgen des Job-Status\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is included? {#what-is-included}"
msgstr "Was ist enthalten? {#what-is-included}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following MCP servers are available:\n"
msgstr "Die folgenden MCP-Server sind verfügbar:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Server {#qiskit-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP Server {#qiskit-mcp-server}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provides core quantum computing capabilities for local development. This server enables AI assistants to create, manipulate, and transpile quantum circuits, as well as serialize them to formats like OpenQASM 3 and QPY.\n"
msgstr "Stellt grundlegende Quantencomputing-Funktionen für die lokale Entwicklung bereit. Dieser Server ermöglicht KI-Assistenten das Erstellen, Bearbeiten und Transpilieren von Quantum Circuits sowie deren Serialisierung in Formate wie OpenQASM 3 und QPY.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime MCP Server {#qiskit-runtime-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime MCP Server {#qiskit-runtime-mcp-server}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provides access to IBM Quantum cloud services through Qiskit Runtime. This enables AI assistants to interact with quantum backends, submit jobs, and retrieve results.\n"
msgstr "Ermöglicht den Zugriff auf IBM Quantum-Cloud-Dienste über Qiskit Runtime. Dadurch können KI-Assistenten mit Quantum Backends interagieren, Jobs einreichen und Ergebnisse abrufen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Docs MCP Server {#qiskit-docs-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit Docs MCP Server {#qiskit-docs-mcp-server}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provides AI assistants with access to the complete Qiskit documentation ecosystem, including SDK module documentation, implementation guides, and best practices. This server enables intelligent retrieval and search across the Qiskit documentation without requiring authentication.\n"
msgstr "Ermöglicht KI-Assistenten den Zugriff auf das gesamte Qiskit-Dokumentations-Ökosystem, einschließlich SDK-Moduldokumentation, Implementierungsanleitungen und Best Practices. Dieser Server ermöglicht intelligentes Abrufen und Suchen in der Qiskit-Dokumentation ohne Authentifizierung.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Server {#qiskit-ibm-transpiler-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Server {#qiskit-ibm-transpiler-mcp-server}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provides AI-powered circuit optimization through the [AI-powered transpiler passes](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes). This server enables AI assistants to optimize quantum circuits using advanced routing and optimization algorithms.\n"
msgstr "Bietet KI-gestützte Circuit-Optimierung über die [KI-gestützten Transpiler-Passes](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes). Dieser Server ermöglicht KI-Assistenten, Quantum Circuits mithilfe fortschrittlicher Routing- und Optimierungsalgorithmen zu optimieren.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Community servers {#community-servers}"
msgstr "Community-Server {#community-servers}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following community-contributed MCP servers are also available:\n"
msgstr "Die folgenden von der Community beigesteuerten MCP-Server sind ebenfalls verfügbar:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Gym MCP Server {#qiskit-gym-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit Gym MCP Server {#qiskit-gym-mcp-server}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Provides reinforcement learning capabilities for quantum circuit synthesis using the [qiskit-gym](https://github.com/AI4quantum/qiskit-gym) library. This server enables AI assistants to use RL-based optimization techniques for quantum circuit transpilation and synthesis.\n"
msgstr "Bietet Reinforcement-Learning-Funktionen für die Quantum-Circuit-Synthese mithilfe der [qiskit-gym](https://github.com/AI4quantum/qiskit-gym)-Bibliothek. Dieser Server ermöglicht KI-Assistenten, RL-basierte Optimierungstechniken für die Transpilation und Synthese von Quantum Circuits einzusetzen.\n"

